<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY---PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>TUE  PiknPay   H1 EPS  10.1	 9.5-11.0	  8.25*</p>
<p>TUE  PiknPay   H1 DIV  3.7	  3.5-4.2	   2.92*</p>
<p>WED  Powertech H1 EPS  21.4	 21.1-21.8	 19.2</p>
<p>* Pick 'n' Pay's 1995 earnings and dividend per share have been restated to take into account the issue of 313.05 million &quot;N&quot; shares on July 1, 1996. The effect is to divide the actual 1995 eps and dps figures by three.</p>
<p>** It is Powertech group policy to declare a single annual dividend at the end of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
